  "content": "<h1 style=\"font-size:2em;font-weight:bold;text-align:center\"><strong>🌟歡迎來到這款迷人的新模組包🌟</strong></h1><hr><p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:1.2em;color:#555\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/NuQV3ZkVxR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1168668/description_7e5fb412-d3df-4f3a-ae36-0e42237e1f7b.png\" width=\"610\" height=\"94\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:1.2em;color:#555\">潛入魔法宇宙，讓不可能化為現實</p><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.wabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fspellnomia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1168668/description_055dddc6-18da-4fc5-af38-be2a6bdcdc78.png\" alt=\"圖片\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"></a></p><hr style=\"border:1px solid #ccc\"><div>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>🔥200款模組🔥</strong></span></h1>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">若想與我合作，請透過<a href=\"https://discord.gg/NuQV3ZkVxR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>或留言聯繫</span></strong></h3>\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\n</div><div><hr></div><div>模組介紹：\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>✨ <strong>魔法核心冒險</strong><br>透過<em>Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks</em>及<em>Galosphere</em>、<em>Arcane EssencePlus</em>等強化模組，擴展魔法能力並創造獨特法術，擊敗敵人或守護盟友</p>\n<p>🌍 <strong>探索世界</strong><br>搭配<em>Biomes O' Plenty</em>、<em>Terralith</em>與<em>Yung's Better Structures</em>等模組，世界每個角落都充滿驚喜。深入危險地牢，或透過<em>Deeper and Darker</em>探索深淵秘境</p>\n<p>🐾 <strong>動態生態系統</strong><br>透過<em>Alex's Mobs</em>和<em>Eco Items</em>遇見迷人生物。使用<em>Ice and Fire</em>對抗巨龍，或透過<em>Critters and Companions</em>與溫馴生物成為夥伴</p>\n<p>🍲 <strong>美食饗宴</strong><br><em>Farmer's Delight</em>及其擴展模組（<em>Alex's Delight</em>、<em>Ender's Delight</em>等）豐富烹飪體驗，將生存轉化為真正的美食之旅</p>\n<p>⚔️ <strong>動態戰略戰鬥</strong><br>透過<em>Better Combat</em>和<em>Spartan Weaponry</em>重塑戰鬥系統，在劍、矛